v>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Ss Submersible Peripheral Pump</h1>\n<p>ss submersible peripheral pump JIADI has provided service and ss submersible peripheral pump to the construction dewatering and groundwater pumping market since 1998. For over 20 years JIADI has gained the respect of our customers by applying all the right solutions to their groundwater problems...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52495246\"/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270928511779141.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image005(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>ss submersible peripheral pump</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270928566096959.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>JIADI has provided service and ss submersible peripheral pump to the construction dewatering and groundwater pumping market since 1998. For over 20 years JIADI has gained the respect of our customers by applying all the right solutions to their groundwater problems on projects both large and small. ss submersible peripheral pump is our main product.</p><p><strong>1. Product Specification</strong></p><p><strong>Brand Name:</strong> JIADI</p><p><strong>Model Name: </strong>4FSm</p><p><strong>Phase:</strong> Single phase</p><p><strong>RPM:</strong> 2850</p><p><strong>Outlet:</strong> G1”</p><p><strong>Q max: </strong>3 m³/h</p><p><strong>Protection Grade:</strong> IP68</p><p><strong>Maximum diameter:</strong> 98mm</p><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><img alt=\"image009.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270930473236268.jpg\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Rotor Shaft<br/><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270932228091870.jpg\" title=\"image011(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·Super-high precision machine process<br/>·Super smooth shaft surface(mirror finish), reduce energy loss and mechanical seal abrasion</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Bearing<br/><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270932346716606.jpg\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·Longer working life<br/>·Help reduce power loss</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Stator<br/><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270932461581613.jpg\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·Cold-rolled Silicon steel with standard pieces<br/>·Keep power durable and efficiency<br/>·Continuous operating guaranteed</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Cable<br/><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270932587046735.jpg\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/></p><p>·Four cores cable<br/>·Various colors available<br/>·Cable produced by JIADI</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Copper Motor<br/><img alt=\"image018(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270933112284975.jpg\" title=\"image018(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·50Hz or 60Hz can be designed<br/>·High work efficiency<br/>·Lower temperature and longer lifespan for the motor</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Control Box  <br/><img alt=\"image020(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270933226994969.jpg\" title=\"image020(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·Control the pump’s operation<br/>·Protecting the motor from burning down<br/>·Fire-resistant materials</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Application</strong></p><p>1- Groundwater supply to waterworks.  </p><p>2- Irrigation in horticulture and agriculture</p><p>3- Groundwater lower pressure boosting</p><p>4- Industrial applications</p><p>5- Water treatment.</p><p>6- Fire control</p><p><strong>5. Company Information</strong></p><p>For more than 25 years, JIADI Pumps has manufactured the pumps with high performance, high quality, which are required for lasting service in the municipal, water, wastewater, sewage, industrial, and construction. JIADI Pumps Industry supplies a wide variety of submersible pumps and pump accessories for many different applications. Some of these products include sewage pumps, stainless steel pumps, self-sucking pumps, grinder pumps, submersible drainage pumps and screw pumps. JIADI Pump provides quality products that are reliable, energy efficient and available at affordable prices. JAIDI Pump is dedicated to providing customer satisfaction and quality products.</p><p><img alt=\"image022(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270934236211865.jpg\" title=\"image022(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. Product Certification</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241411154549302.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO14001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">OHSAS18001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">CE </td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241411169751193.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">GS </td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO9001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">RoHS</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>7. Package and Shipping</strong></p><p>Trade terms: FOB, CIF, CFR (CNF), etc are acceptable</p><p>Port: Ningbo, Lianyungang, Shanghai</p><p>Lead time: 20-30 days</p><p>Shipment: By sea, by air and by express delivery. Trial order 